6. Unmute (Kyutai)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Conductor's design (local_astra/conductor/) is derived from Kyutai's Unmute handler
(MIT): the OpenAI-Realtime-style event vocabulary Unmute uses and its pause-probability
end-of-turn threshold (0.6). Design derived from; no code copied.

